{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-areaguide-detail-template-js","path":"/area-guides/arabian-ranches/","result":{"data":{"strapiAreaGuide":{"id":"b15bc165-20f1-52e9-88c6-1f8b8fee1171","description":{"data":{"description":"<p>The perfect family friendly community where Arabian-inspired elegance meets modern living, offering serene landscapes, world-class amenities, and a true sense of home.</p>"}},"video_ask_url":null,"amenities":{"strapi_json_value":["Luxury Living"],"id":"46eab189-f1a1-5a7d-8eff-8b760abbeda2"},"title":"Arabian Ranches","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Untitled_2_8_b1e3940fd4.jpg"},"masterplan_image":null,"sponsored_projects":[],"teams":[],"strapi_id":34,"slug":"arabian-ranches","custom_property_slug":null,"publish":true,"more_info":[{"strapi_id":392,"question":"Area","id":"d3799872-4e6b-5bf0-a7aa-79e826738593","answer":{"data":{"answer":"<p>Located in the heart of Dubai, Arabian Ranches 1 is a haven of peace and modernity. This residential haven is a great option for those who want to live in harmony with nature and a wide variety of other residents and conveniences. Lush parks, winding paths, and community pools give opportunities for rest and enjoyment inside the neighbourhood. A round of golf at the exclusive Arabian Ranches Golf Club is the perfect way to take in the surrounding desert scenery. The Jumeirah English Speaking School (JESS) and Raffles Nursery are two well regarded schools in the area that provide excellent education for children. The Arabian Ranches Souk provides convenient shopping for necessities, while the Ranches Community Centre provides entertainment and restaurants. The neighbourhood strikes a nice mix between rural tranquilly and proximity to the buzz of Dubai, thanks to its central location.<br>&nbsp;</p>","id":"6cc9b967-6873-5f3d-9e50-8203de456b95"}}},{"strapi_id":393,"question":"Properties","id":"9de4e589-012a-5a67-89c7-f23c833ded13","answer":{"data":{"answer":"<p>In keeping with the community's dedication to luxury, comfort, and a serene living environment, Arabian Ranches 1 offers a wide variety of property types, from spacious villas with 3 to 6 bedrooms to well-designed townhouses for families of all sizes to one-of-a-kind courtyard homes with central courtyards and private pools.</p>","id":"1f26c8ab-2004-57ae-a49c-62951d4ae010"}}},{"strapi_id":394,"question":"Location","id":"d01dfeae-9d68-574e-8d22-21655402fcb3","answer":{"data":{"answer":"<p>Arabian Ranches private gated community is located in wadi safa 7, This sought-after community offers a tranquil escape while remaining well-connected to Dubai's key destinations.</p><ul><li>20 Minutes to Dubai Marina</li><li>25 Minutes to Palm Jumeirah&nbsp;</li><li>20 Minutes to Mall of Emirates</li></ul>","id":"6f02e4ae-7211-5129-aec3-84368147d8fb"}}},{"strapi_id":395,"question":"Amenities and Facilities","id":"bca83304-d49c-5768-933f-7bfc7b817d68","answer":{"data":{"answer":"<h3>Retail:&nbsp;</h3><p>Arabian Ranches Souk, located within the neighbourhood, offers retail, grocery, and eating options for residents' convenience and shopping.</p><h3>Education:</h3><p>Arabian Ranches 1 families are close to top schools like Jumeirah English Speaking School (JESS) and Raffles Nursery.</p><h3>Dining:&nbsp;</h3><p>Arabian Ranches Souk has a variety of restaurants and cafés for all tastes.</p><h3>Healthcare:&nbsp;</h3><p>The adjacent Emirates Hospital Clinic provides high-quality healthcare to residents.</p><h3>Facility/Convenience:&nbsp;</h3><p>Community parks, swimming pools, and sports courts encourage an active lifestyle in Arabian Ranches 1. Dubai Polo &amp; Equestrian Club offers residents recreational and equestrian amenities, improving community convenience.<br>&nbsp;</p>","id":"10ff27ef-e939-51c9-bc1b-c5568f1d4c17"}}},{"strapi_id":396,"question":"Projects in Arabian Ranches","id":"1cfc717a-0425-59b3-a787-e63932d02f8b","answer":{"data":{"answer":"<p>Within Arabian Ranches, you may find the pinnacle of luxury living amid a plethora of outstanding residential developments. Emaar's developments include large, elegant villas and townhouses set within verdant gardens that redefine the meaning of modern elegance. Each development, from the simple yet functional Reem and Rosa neighbourhoods to the luxurious Samara and Azalea communities, exemplifies the finest levels of design, construction, and amenity. Anya, also by Emaar, offers cutting-edge villas fit for a high-class living, and it is one of these exceptional new communities.&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;</p>","id":"912c4d27-8191-5004-a57e-eb7e57258e7b"}}}],"longitude":55.3221308,"latitude":25.0158786,"content":{"data":{"content":"<p>Arabian Ranches 1, a quiet Dubai neighbourhood, combines modern living with nature. This desirable community offers a variety of houses for different lifestyles in tranquil surroundings. Each home exudes comfort and elegance, from huge villas with private gardens to thoughtfully planned townhouses.&nbsp;</p><p>Residents enjoy parks, pools, and sports facilities, creating a strong community. Arabian Ranches 1 is more than a home—it's an invitation to live a harmonious and opulent existence in Dubai's heart with its central location, quality schools, retail outlets, and local attractions.<br>&nbsp;</p>"}},"ggfx_results":[{"src_cftle":"i/Untitled_1_7_0b0f216fc2.jpg","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/744x/Untitled_1_7_0b0f216fc2.webp","transform":"744x","format":"webp"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/1773x/Untitled_1_7_0b0f216fc2.webp","transform":"1773x","format":"webp"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/376x/Untitled_1_7_0b0f216fc2.webp","transform":"376x","format":"webp"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/744x/Untitled_1_7_0b0f216fc2.jpg","transform":"744x","format":"jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws